      "tips": [
        {
          "text": "DSA: It is asked by most companies in Online Assessments and Interviews. Without DSA, you won’t be able to clear OA and appear for interviews. Apart from doing DSA sheets also give contests to practice solving questions randomly with a time limit. If possible, do CP.",
          "category": "Coding preparation",
          "page": 2
        },
        {
          "text": "Aptitude: Some companies ask aptitude questions in OA. I did not explicitly practise as I was confident about it but do practise if you are not sure.",
          "category": "OA preparation",
          "page": 3
        },
        {
          "text": "CS Fundamentals: These are very important for interviews and OA. OOPS in Java (and your preferred language as well), SQL, DBMS are most important. OS, CCN and system design are also important.",
          "category": "Technical preparation",
          "page": 3
        },
        {
          "text": "Resume: You should know your resume well. Have 2 good projects in your resume. It's good to have internships but not necessary.",
